@startuml
title PayLink - Payment State Diagram

[*] --> Initiated : Payment request created/confirmed (FR9)

state Initiated
state FundsHeld
state SentToBiller
state Unknown
state Completed
state Failed
state Rejected
state Refunded

Initiated --> FundsHeld : Validation/fraud checks passed and sufficient funds; total held (FR12)
Initiated --> Rejected : Amount/limits/velocity or pre-checks failed; no funds charged (FR18, BR2, BR8)

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : Biller request sent (FR12)

SentToBiller --> Completed : Biller confirms success (immediate or async callback) (FR14)
SentToBiller --> Failed : Biller confirms failure (immediate or async callback); hold released (FR12, FR14)
SentToBiller --> Unknown : No timely response within 10 seconds; funds remain held (FR13, BR9)

Unknown --> Completed : Confirmed success after re-query/reconciliation (assumed based on BR10)
Unknown --> Failed : Confirmed failure after re-query/reconciliation; hold released (assumed based on BR10)

Failed --> Refunded : Refund processed (per brief note: Failed → Refunded) 

Completed --> Refunded : Refund approved by Support for completed payment (FR27; transition detail may need team confirmation)

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]
Failed --> [*]

note right of Unknown
  Re-query at 1, 5, 15 minutes (BR10),
  then wait for reconciliation/support review.
  Funds stay held while Unknown.
end note

note bottom of Rejected
  Final state: no money held/charged.
end note

note bottom of Completed
  Final state: payment successful.
end note

note bottom of Refunded
  Final state: funds returned/refund completed.
end note

@enduml